# 服务器部署规则 - AI无限画布

当用户要求部署后端(ai-canvas-server)和管理端(ai-canvas-admin)到服务器时，遵循本规则。

## 项目架构

| 组件 | 技术栈 | 说明 |
|------|--------|------|
| ai-canvas-server | Spring Boot 3.4.4 + Java 17 + MyBatis-Plus + MySQL 8 | 后端 API 服务，端口 8090 |
| ai-canvas-admin | Vue 3 + Element Plus + Vite | 管理后台 SPA，构建后打入 JAR 的 static/admin 目录 |
| ai-canvas | Vue 3 + Tauri | 客户端桌面应用，不部署到服务器 |

## 判断部署类型

先 SSH 连接服务器检查环境：

```bash
java -version && mysql --version && systemctl is-active ai-canvas
```

- 如果上述命令全部成功 → 执行 **【更新部署】**
- 如果任何一项缺失 → 执行 **【首次部署】**

---

## 【更新部署】（日常使用，最常见）

只需 3 步：构建 → 上传 → 重启

### 1. 本地构建

```bash
# 构建管理端前端
cd ai-canvas-admin
npm install
npm run build

# 构建后端 JAR（管理端已打入 static/admin）
cd ../ai-canvas-server
mvn clean package -DskipTests
```

### 2. 上传 JAR 到服务器

```python
import paramiko

client = paramiko.SSHClient()
client.set_missing_host_key_policy(paramiko.AutoAddPolicy())
client.connect('SERVER_IP', port=22, username='root', password='PASSWORD', timeout=10)

sftp = client.open_sftp()
sftp.put(r'ai-canvas-server\target\ai-canvas-server-0.1.0.jar', '/opt/ai-canvas/ai-canvas-server.jar')
sftp.close()
```

### 3. 重启服务

```bash
systemctl restart ai-canvas
```

验证：

```bash
journalctl -u ai-canvas -f --no-pager -n 20
# 看到 "Started AiCatServerApplication" 即成功
```

**更新部署完毕，无需其他操作。**

---

## 【首次部署】（仅新服务器执行一次）

### 1. 安装环境

```bash
apt-get update -qq
apt-get install -y openjdk-17-jdk-headless mysql-server nginx
systemctl start mysql && systemctl enable mysql
```

### 2. 配置 MySQL

```bash
# 设置 root 密码
mysql -u root -e 'ALTER USER "root"@"localhost" IDENTIFIED WITH mysql_native_password BY "YOUR_DB_PASSWORD"; FLUSH PRIVILEGES;'
```

### 3. 导入数据库

将 `ai-canvas-server/src/main/resources/db/schema.sql` 上传到服务器并执行：

```bash
mysql -u root -pYOUR_DB_PASSWORD < /tmp/schema.sql
```

数据库名：`aicat`，共 9 张表。

### 4. 创建应用目录并上传 JAR

```bash
mkdir -p /opt/ai-canvas
```

上传 `ai-canvas-server-0.1.0.jar` 到 `/opt/ai-canvas/ai-canvas-server.jar`

### 5. 创建 systemd 服务

写入 `/etc/systemd/system/ai-canvas.service`：

```ini
[Unit]
Description=AI Canvas Server
After=network.target mysql.service
Requires=mysql.service

[Service]
Type=simple
User=root
WorkingDirectory=/opt/ai-canvas
Environment=DB_PASSWORD=YOUR_DB_PASSWORD
Environment=JWT_SECRET=YOUR_JWT_SECRET_AT_LEAST_256_BITS
ExecStart=/usr/bin/java -Xms256m -Xmx512m -jar /opt/ai-canvas/ai-canvas-server.jar
Restart=always
RestartSec=10

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

```bash
systemctl daemon-reload
systemctl enable ai-canvas
systemctl start ai-canvas
```

### 6. 配置 Nginx

写入 `/etc/nginx/sites-available/ai-canvas`：

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name YOUR_DOMAIN_OR_IP;

    location = /admin/ {
        rewrite ^ /admin/index.html last;
    }

    location = /admin {
        rewrite ^ /admin/index.html last;
    }

    location /admin/assets/ {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8090;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        expires 7d;
        add_header Cache-Control "public, immutable";
    }

    location /admin/ {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8090;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
    }

    location /api/ {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8090;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_connect_timeout 60s;
        proxy_send_timeout 60s;
        proxy_read_timeout 60s;
    }

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8090;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
    }
}
```

```bash
ln -sf /etc/nginx/sites-available/ai-canvas /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/ai-canvas
rm -f /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/default
nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx && systemctl enable nginx
```

### 7. 防火墙放行

```bash
ufw allow 80/tcp
ufw allow 443/tcp
```

云平台安全组也需要放行 80、443 端口。

